---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
import CarouselReader from '../components/CarouselReader.astro';
import {foundingPass,readingPreview} from '../data/founding-pass.mjs';
import '../styles/founding-pass.css';
import '../styles/carousel-library.css';
---
<Platform title="Founding Membership" description="Digivated Founding Membership is $5 once for the first 25 members. It includes full carousels, the full UI/UX Prompt Packet, and one reviewed feature.">
  <header class="page-intro founding-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Digivated Founding Membership</p><h1>Digivated Founding Membership</h1><p class="lede">Founding Membership is the main way to get the full Digivated library. It includes full educational carousels, the full UI/UX Prompt Packet, and one featured project submission. The collection grows as carousels are added.</p><div class="founding-price"><strong>${foundingPass.priceUSD} USD</strong><span>One-time membership · First {foundingPass.introductoryLimit} members</span></div><p class="founding-launch-state"><span class="founding-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Available now. Not a subscription. One payment for this membership.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href={foundingPass.checkoutUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get membership · $5 once ↗</a><a class="button" href="#member-sign-in">Already purchased? Sign in</a></div><p class="quiet"><a href="https://x.com/digivatedx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read Digivated on X ↗</a></p><p class="quiet founding-price-note">The ${foundingPass.priceUSD} offer is for the first {foundingPass.introductoryLimit} members. Applicable taxes are shown at Gumroad checkout. The packet and the promotional spot are still available on their own.</p></header>
  <section class="founding-section" aria-labelledby="founding-how"><h2 id="founding-how">From purchase to full access</h2><ol class="founding-purchase-steps"><li><strong>Buy on Gumroad.</strong><p>Pay $5 once. Use an email you can access and keep your purchase receipt.</p></li><li><strong>Return here to sign in.</strong><p>Enter your receipt email or license key in the form below. You won't need to pay again.</p></li><li><strong>Choose what to open.</strong><p>Read full carousels, use the prompt packet, or submit your project for its included feature review.</p></li></ol><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/carousels">Browse carousels</a><a class="button" href="/library">Open prompt packet</a><a class="button" href="/submit-project">Request feature review</a></div></section>
  <section class="founding-section" aria-labelledby="pass-includes"><p class="eyebrow">What membership includes</p><h2 id="pass-includes">Three things, included once.</h2><div class="founding-benefits"><article><span class="founding-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span><h3>Full carousels</h3><p>Read past the public preview. Each carousel has one clear objective, and the collection grows as carousels are added.</p></article><article><span class="founding-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span><h3>The full UI/UX Prompt Packet</h3><p>Open all 75 prompts, workflows, and checklists. The packet is also sold alone for $4 USD once.</p></article><article><span class="founding-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span><h3>One featured submission</h3><p>Submit one project for a featured spot with no extra payment. Review is required, and a feature is never guaranteed.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="founding-section" id="reading-preview" aria-labelledby="reading-preview-title"><p class="eyebrow">Made for a phone. Comfortable to read.</p><h2 id="reading-preview-title">One idea at a time.</h2><p>Swipe through the cards, use the arrows, or open the text version below. You control the pace.</p><CarouselReader slides={readingPreview}/></section>
  <section class="founding-section founding-inventory" aria-labelledby="founding-collection-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">The founding collection</p><h2 id="founding-collection-title">Carousels in this collection</h2><p>The collection is growing. Titles appear here as carousels are added. The first four slides of each carousel stay open to everyone.</p></div><div class="founding-inventory-state"><strong>Collection growing</strong><p id="founding-inventory-empty">There are no member carousels available yet.</p><ul id="founding-inventory-list" class="founding-inventory-list" hidden></ul><a href="/ui-ux-prompt-packet">See the UI/UX Prompt Packet →</a></div></section>
  <section class="founding-section" id="member-sign-in" aria-labelledby="member-sign-in-title"><h2 id="member-sign-in-title">Already purchased?</h2><p>Sign in with the license key or the email from your Gumroad receipt. A Prompt Packet license does not open the carousels. Founding Membership opens the carousels and the full packet.</p><form id="founding-access-form" class="carousel-access" method="post" action="/api/founding-access"><label>Gumroad license key<input name="license" type="password" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" maxlength="35"/></label><p class="quiet">or</p><label>Purchase email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254"/></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Sign in</button><p id="founding-access-status" role="status"></p></form><button class="button" id="founding-sign-out" type="button" hidden>Sign out of founding access</button><p class="quiet"><a href="/carousels">Open the full carousels</a> or <a href="/library">open the full packet</a> after you sign in. A membership license also works on the <a href="/access">packet access page</a>.</p></section>
  <section class="founding-section founding-terms" aria-labelledby="founding-pass-terms"><h2 id="founding-pass-terms">One payment. A clearly defined membership.</h2><dl><div><dt>What you keep</dt><dd>Permanent access to the full founding carousels and the full UI/UX Prompt Packet, plus one featured project submission. It is not a monthly subscription, and there are no automatic renewals.</dd></div><div><dt>The featured submission</dt><dd>One request per membership, with no extra payment. Digivated still reviews it. Review can decline the feature. A feature is never guaranteed.</dd></div><div><dt>The first 25 members</dt><dd>The introductory price is ${foundingPass.priceUSD} USD for the first {foundingPass.introductoryLimit} members. After that, this offer closes. A later offer may have a different price.</dd></div><div><dt>Other products</dt><dd>The UI/UX Prompt Packet remains available alone for $4 USD once. A packet purchase does not include the carousels or the featured submission. The $3 promotional spot also remains available.</dd></div></dl></section>

  <script>import '../scripts/carousel-reader.js';</script>
  <script>import '../scripts/carousel-library.js';</script>
</Platform>
